WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
08:40 — Voice capture. In the rickshaw Zara hits voice capture on her phone — if she can say it before the idea vanishes, it is saved on-device.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.000
11:00 — Tag on iPad. Studio iPad tags the morning captures by project so they do not drown in a single undated inbox.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.500
18:00 — Laptop review. Laptop idea list at end of day; she promotes one seed and parks the rest without guilt.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:26.000
19:00 — Note detail. Note detail on the laptop expands the keeper into something she can pitch tomorrow.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.500
19:30 — Phone. Phone inbox feels lighter. Saying it was enough to keep it.

